    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01288",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“千重子，咱们要不干脆把这家批发店卖掉，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Chieko, why don't we simply sell this wholesale shop,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01288",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "搬到西阵去，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "move to Nishijin,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01288",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "再不然就到寂静的南禅寺或冈崎一带找间小房子住下，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "or else find a small house somewhere around quiet Nanzenji or Okazaki and settle down there,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01288",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "咱们两人设计一张和服和腰带图案好不好？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and the two of us design a kimono and obi pattern together?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01288",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "你受得了那份贫苦吗？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Could you bear that kind of poverty?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
